\f0\b\fs48 \cf0 02 \'b7 The Problem\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa320\partightenfactor0

\f2\i\b0\fs32 \cf0 Asset:
\f1\i0  02.mov\

\f2\i Caption:
\f1\i0  Prototype of multi-material masking in Classic Sketch to Render\
Masking is where a designer makes decisions worth comparing. In the classic app it happened in a modal: a window that takes over the screen, does its job, and hands you back.\
A modal would have worked but masking is exactly when they\'92d want to review options and reference existing designs.\
A modal on top puts the board out of reach.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa398\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs48 \cf0 03 \'b7 Constraints\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls2\ilvl0
\fs32 \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 A toolset built for a modal.
\f1\b0  Masking already had three selection tools (smart mask, lasso, brush) each with its own controls.\
\ls2\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Two navigation systems on the same gestures.
\f1\b0  The masking tool and the canvas each have their own pan and zoom.\
\ls2\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Platform rules I couldn\'92t change.
\f1\b0  Up to three materials, masked separately, and no generation until all materials are masked.\
\ls2\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
